### 13. Search by city = minsk
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/search?city=minsk

### 14. Search by city = Moskow
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/search?city=Moskow

### 15. Search by brand = Marriott
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/search?brand=Marriott

### 16. Search by country = Belarus
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/search?country=Belarus

### 17. Search by name
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/search?name=Hotel%20Mogilev

