### ERROR CASES

### 26. ERROR — hotel not found
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/hotels/999

### 27. ERROR — invalid hotel id in path
GET http://localhost:8092/property-view/hotels/abc

### 28. ERROR — create without name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8092/property-view/hotels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Hilton",
  "address": {
    "houseNumber": 1,
    "street": "Test Street",
    "city": "Minsk",
    "country": "Belarus",
    "postCode": "220000"
  },
  "contacts": {
    "phone": "+375 17 000-00-00",
    "email": "test@example.com"
  },
  "arrivalTime": {
    "checkIn": "14:00",
    "checkOut": "12:00"
  }
}

